<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>Solar CMS</title>

        {{ encore_entry_link_tags('default') }}
        {{ encore_entry_script_tags('default') }}
    </head>
    <body>
        <div id="app"></div>

        {# Stats plugin tracking beacon (steps 34-35): its own tiny, deferred,
           dependency-free script - never part of the `default` bundle above,
           so it can never add to its parse/load cost. A plain <script> tag
           (not encore_entry_script_tags) since it isn't an Encore entry - it's
           built by the Stats plugin's own webpack config, like every other
           plugin remote, under the existing /build alias. 404s harmlessly if
           the plugin isn't installed, same non-blocking assumption already
           made for the Portfolio/News/Newsletter routes below. #}
        <script src="/build/plugins/stats/tracker.js" defer></script>
    </body>
</html>
